contentText:
For Zara Larsson , the Midnight Sun era still has some daylight left.

Although the Swedish pop star already has plenty of new music on the horizon, she&#8217;s not ready to move on from her latest album just yet, especially when there&#8217;s still a song she feels deserves its moment.

